WEBVTT

00:07:26.962 --> 00:07:30.138
msichana wa miaka nane angeweza kuolewa
na mwanaume wa miaka 30.

00:07:30.686 --> 00:07:32.091
Hilo haliwezi kutokea tena.

00:07:32.115 --> 00:07:34.472
Mwaka 2016, Sheria ya mtoto
ilifanya hilo kuwa kosa

00:07:34.496 --> 00:07:37.115
na kufanya umri wa chini kuolewa kuwa miaka 18.

00:07:37.139 --> 00:07:39.369
Hiyo ndiyo I ya INSPIRE:

00:07:39.393 --> 00:07:41.784
kupitisha na kutekeleza sheria.

00:07:43.058 --> 00:07:45.874
Cambodia inatoa msaada wa malezi,

00:07:45.898 --> 00:07:48.280
msaada kwa wazazi na walezi
nchi nzima,

00:07:48.304 --> 00:07:51.145
hivyo wazazi wanapewa uwezo
kulea watoto wao

00:07:51.169 --> 00:07:55.180
na kuweka nidhamu kwa namna
isiyo ya kikatili nyumbani.

00:07:55.204 --> 00:07:56.752
hiyo ndiyo P ya INSPIRE,

00:07:56.776 --> 00:07:58.529
msaada kwa wazazi na walezi.

00:07:58.553 --> 00:07:59.712
Kule Uphilipino,

00:07:59.736 --> 00:08:03.545
Kuna vituo 100 vilivyowekwa
kuwalinda wanawake na watoto nchi nzima.